'''Buzzwole''' (Japanese: '''マッシブーン''' ''Massivoon'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

