==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Buzzwole|77}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*The '''Ground Beat''' attack is named after a "ground beat," a term for the basic underlying beat of a song. The term is more commonly used in the context of {{wp|jazz}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

